rca_of_the_issue.root_cause:
Mismatch between how detailed recipes are saved vs how AI Chef searches:
1. Chat generates recipe with ID (e.g., 15bf01bd7dde4491)
2. When user clicks 'View Recipe', /api/recipes/detailed is called which saves to detailed_recipes with key={title_lower: recipe_title}
3. When user clicks 'AI Chef', frontend navigates to /recipes/{id}/ai-chef
4. AI Chef endpoint calls /api/chat/ai-chef/recipe/{id} which searches detailed_recipes with {id: recipe_id}
5. No match because detailed_recipes has title_lower key, not id
